{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udd25 ENTER THE MAGIC ARENA \u2013 COMBINE ELEMENTS &amp; UNLEASH DESTRUCTION! \ud83d\udd25</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the <strong>ultimate battle arena</strong>, where only the strongest will survive! In <strong>MAGLA</strong>, you'll fight against waves of enemies, level up, and unlock devastating skills by combining powerful elements.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u2694\ufe0f  ACTION COMBAT</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defeat enemies to gain experience, level up, and unlock <strong>unique upgrades</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect <strong>Item Cards</strong> to enhance your abilities and customize your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Combine Fire, Ice, and Earth</strong> to create powerful, game-changing skills!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong> </strong>\u2744\u00a0<strong>ELEMENTAL SPELL SYSTEM\u00a0</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fire</strong>: High damage, burns enemies over time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Ice</strong>: Slows down enemies and can form deadly <strong>Ice Swords &amp; Ice Spears</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Earth</strong>: Summon <strong>Tornadoes</strong> and unleash <strong>Lightning Strikes</strong> to devastate the battlefield.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mix them to unleash devastating magic!</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u26a1<strong> EVERY RUN IS A NEW STRATEGY</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from <strong>Upgrade Cards</strong> each time you level up to shape your build.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you focus on <strong>raw firepower</strong>, <strong>freezing blades</strong>, or <strong>storm-infused destruction</strong>?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you ready to dominate the <strong>magic arena</strong>? Step in and prove your power to the world!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3607510?t=1745495425","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3607510?t=1745495425","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607510/b65fa1847c12df6cd0b246d92cef51a205916516/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745495425","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607510/b65fa1847c12df6cd0b246d92cef51a205916516/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745495425","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udd25 ENTER THE MAGIC ARENA \u2013 COMBINE ELEMENTS &amp; UNLEASH DESTRUCTION! \ud83d\udd25</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the <strong>ultimate battle arena</strong>, where only the strongest will survive! In <strong>MAGLA</strong>, you'll fight against waves of enemies, level up, and unlock devastating skills by combining powerful elements.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u2694\ufe0f  ACTION COMBAT</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defeat enemies to gain experience, level up, and unlock <strong>unique upgrades</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect <strong>Item Cards</strong> to enhance your abilities and customize your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Combine Fire, Ice, and Earth</strong> to create powerful, game-changing skills!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong> </strong>\u2744\u00a0<strong>ELEMENTAL SPELL SYSTEM\u00a0</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fire</strong>: High damage, burns enemies over time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Ice</strong>: Slows down enemies and can form deadly <strong>Ice Swords &amp; Ice Spears</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Earth</strong>: Summon <strong>Tornadoes</strong> and unleash <strong>Lightning Strikes</strong> to devastate the battlefield.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mix them to unleash devastating magic!</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u26a1<strong> EVERY RUN IS A NEW STRATEGY</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from <strong>Upgrade Cards</strong> each time you level up to shape your build.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you focus on <strong>raw firepower</strong>, <strong>freezing blades</strong>, or <strong>storm-infused destruction</strong>?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you ready to dominate the <strong>magic arena</strong>? Step in and prove your power to the world!</p>","developers":["Mighty Bear"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607510/4b5e42d176a6d3a47fb6e06ed500fa13865a5d30/header.jpg?t=1745495425","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257117475,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257117475/movie480.mp4?t=1743449270","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257117475/movie_max.mp4?t=1743449270"},"name":"MAGLA Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257117475/0b35791d19c58aa8a9ad7a99ecf655225860b5ff/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1743449270","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257117475/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1743449270","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257117475/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1743449270"}}],"name":"MAGLA","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 (32/64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</stron